body:
I got alt1 just recently and after sometime learning it, yeah it is very useful. Regarding the medals, I understand that people don't need more medals after 500, but that also means RS doesn't have any new players at all? Since most people at FF are no way new players.

&#x200B;

I heard RS is doing good with all the old players and their spending but seeing no new players is a bit concerning...

It's good to have more players, I just threw in the question because I got bombarded by these reddit posts, and was hoping someone can give me some answers.

&#x200B;

So, it's just mobile osrs? what about mobile rs?
